                <pb facs="0373" n="367" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg367"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Curry to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 2,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Curry asks whether the amount mentioned in his telegram regarding the Mora
                    claim is acceptable. If so, he thinks it important to bring the matter to an
                    immediate close.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
